      "quote": "Studies were included if they met the following criteria: pediatric patients (<18 years) diagnosed with OSA using PSG based on widely accepted diagnostic guidelines at the time of publication and quantitative data available for outcomes of interest before and after surgery... the study design should be case-control, cohort, randomized controlled trials (RCTs), or before-after studies.",
      "reason": "Population (pediatric <18 with PSG-diagnosed OSA), outcome requirement (quantitative pre/post data), and eligible study designs are clearly specified; exclusion criteria for complicated populations are also given (text_7)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "In addition, the study should be published in English, and the study design should be case-control, cohort, randomized controlled trials (RCTs), or before-after studies.",
      "reason": "Language restriction (English) is specified, but no dissemination date range or publication status criteria are reported."
