      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence distinguishes exclusion of studies because outcomes were not measured from exclusion because outcome results were not reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "To understand the effect of age on AT outcomes, participants were grouped into multiple age thresholds according to study-reported means of 0-5 vs. >5, 0-6 vs. >6, 0-7 vs. >7, and 0-8 vs. >8 years... Subgroup analyses were also conducted based on each predefined age category to explore the age differences in response to treatment.",
